000\">Türkmenistanyň kanunçylygynyň esaslary</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Jemgyýetçilik ylymlarynyň esaslary</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Häzirki zaman türkmen jemgyýeti</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Bedenterbiýe</font></li></ul></div><div open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" justify;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: \" 14px;\"=\"\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" justify;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: \" 14px;\"=\"\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700 !important;\">Toplum: Umumy matematiki we tebigy – ylmy dersler toplumy</span></font></div><div open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" justify;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: \" 14px;\"=\"\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div open=\"\" sans\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-align:=\"\" justify;\"=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: \" 14px;\"=\"\"><ul style=\"padding-left: 2rem;\"><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Häzirki zaman kompýuter tehnologiýalary</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Ekologiýa we daşky gurşawy goramak</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Umumy himiýa</font></li><li style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Umumy biologiýa</font></li></ul></div><div open=\"\" s